    <string name="settings_check_updates">Check for updates</string>
    <string name="settings_updates_note">The only thing here that uses the network. It runs in a separate process, only when you press it, and sends nothing. What you type never leaves the device.</string>
    <string name="settings_typing_note">2-9 pick a letter group. 0 is space. 1 is punctuation, and holding it opens the language list. Up and down walk the alternatives, and so do channel up and down. Left and right move the caret. Holding left deletes. Centre submits, back closes.\n\nAccept is optional: pressing the next group key accepts the previous letter on its own.</string>
